message: "If you use DepthDif in your research, please cite this software."
type: software
title: "DepthDif: Ambient Diffusion for a Global Dense Reconstruction of Subsurface Ocean Variables from Extremely Sparse Inputs"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: 2026-08-26
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.22111274"
authors:
  - family-names: "Donike"
    given-names: "Simon"
  - family-names: "Cartuyvels"
    given-names: "Ruben"
abstract: >-
  DepthDif reconstructs dense subsurface ocean temperature and salinity fields
  from sparse EN4/ARGO profiles using conditional diffusion.
keywords:
  - "conditional diffusion"
  - "ocean reconstruction"
  - "salinity"
  - "subsurface ocean"
  - "temperature"
repository-code: "https://github.com/simon-donike/DepthDif"
url: "https://depthdif.donike.net/"
